  "not_a_savegame": "This is NOT byte-compatible with the server savegame and cannot be. SaveGame (blakserv/savegame.c:97) writes a whole-VM binary image — classes, resources, system node, every object, list nodes, timers, users. A client sees a thin projection of one object out of that graph. The parts it cannot see would have to be invented, and an invented save corrupts a world rather than restoring one.",
  "reading_it": {
